<catsoop-section>Question Types</catsoop-section>

Question types are embedded in a page with a
<code>&lt;question TYPE&gt;</code> block.
The following authoring references describe several commonly used question
types:

* [The `pythonic` question type](CURRENT/pythonic), for grading Python
  expressions, including multi-line expressions and several related input
  fields.
* [The `pythoncode` question type](CURRENT/pythoncode), for grading functions
  and programs with one or more sandboxed test cases.
* [The `checkoff` question type](CURRENT/checkoff), for staff-approved
  conversations, demonstrations, and lab milestones.

